# Push after every change

When a code change is finished (feature, fix, or follow-up), do not wait to be asked:

1. Commit the relevant files with a short message focused on why.
2. Push to `main` immediately.
3. If HTTPS auth fails, push with `git@github.com:RahulChandrakarr/Day-1.git`.
4. Never force-push, never skip hooks, never commit `.env` or secrets.

This overrides waiting for an explicit "commit" or "push" in this repo.
